<?xml version="1.0"?><iai friendlyname="Means of transport" id="0017271d" height="400" width="556" hasaudio="0" hascredits="1" lang="E" basecontroltype="DragDrop" outlinecolorid="1" skinstyle="Standard" skinlib="standard"><slides><slide type="dragdrop" sequence="1" slideid="1"><standardslide><toptext textstyleid="1"><text>&lt;html&gt;¿Por qué medio se desplaza cada vehículo: tierra, mar o aire?&lt;/html&gt;</text></toptext><image>0017271d.swf</image><bgimage>DDGv_standard_bg.swf</bgimage><imagerefid/><items><item id="0" seq="1" zindex="1" sequence="1"><image inbucketwidth="67" inbucketheight="67" onstagewidth="57" onstageheight="57" popwidth="96" popheight="96" onstagex="345" onstagey="263" baseheight="192" basewidth="192" pctstage="30" pctpop="50" pctbucket="35">1_ClipperShip.jpg</image><hotarea><point><x>18</x><y>324</y></point><point><x>146</x><y>270</y></point><point><x>179</x><y>270</y></point><point><x>234</x><y>260</y></point><point><x>286</x><y>220</y></point><point><x>344</x><y>201</y></point><point><x>369</x><y>178</y></point><point><x>413</x><y>154</y></point><point><x>412</x><y>326</y></point><point><x>17</x><y>326</y></point><point><x>19</x><y>326</y></point><point><x>18</x><y>324</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Barco velero</tooltext><solvedtooltext>El barco velero es un medio de transporte acuático. Fue muy utilizado por piratas y corsarios. Luego llegó el barco de vapor y desapareció. Hoy los veleros se utilizan de forma deportiva, en atractivas regatas, o para viajar de forma ociosa y sin prisa.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B82B4C7</imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="1" seq="1" zindex="2" sequence="2"><image inbucketwidth="67" inbucketheight="67" onstagewidth="57" onstageheight="57" popwidth="96" popheight="96" onstagex="270" onstagey="145" baseheight="192" basewidth="192" pctstage="30" pctpop="50" pctbucket="35">2_Car.jpg</image><hotarea><point><x>2</x><y>122</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>329</y></point><point><x>26</x><y>329</y></point><point><x>149</x><y>272</y></point><point><x>231</x><y>262</y></point><point><x>263</x><y>248</y></point><point><x>273</x><y>227</y></point><point><x>352</x><y>197</y></point><point><x>371</x><y>175</y></point><point><x>410</x><y>153</y></point><point><x>409</x><y>107</y></point><point><x>354</x><y>124</y></point><point><x>266</x><y>116</y></point><point><x>207</x><y>113</y></point><point><x>179</x><y>127</y></point><point><x>60</x><y>142</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>124</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>122</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Automóvil</tooltext><solvedtooltext>El coche es un medio de transporte terrestre. Sirve para desplazarnos con nuestros equipajes. La mayor parte de los coches se mueven con gasolina, pero también pueden hacerlo con electricidad.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>42D9892D</imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="2" seq="1" zindex="3" sequence="3"><image inbucketwidth="67" inbucketheight="67" onstagewidth="57" onstageheight="57" popwidth="96" popheight="96" onstagex="348" onstagey="122" baseheight="192" basewidth="192" pctstage="30" pctpop="50" pctbucket="35">3_Train.jpg</image><hotarea><point><x>411</x><y>118</y></point><point><x>411</x><y>171</y></point><point><x>378</x><y>188</y></point><point><x>240</x><y>249</y></point><point><x>0</x><y>327</y></point><point><x>4</x><y>125</y></point><point><x>60</x><y>146</y></point><point><x>106</x><y>131</y></point><point><x>210</x><y>122</y></point><point><x>255</x><y>101</y></point><point><x>294</x><y>124</y></point><point><x>351</x><y>115</y></point><point><x>410</x><y>119</y></point><point><x>411</x><y>118</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Tren</tooltext><solvedtooltext>El tren es un medio de transporte terrestre. Muchos trenes desplazan personas en unos vagones y en otros transportan mercancías. Al tren que va bajo tierra se le llama metro.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B826653</imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="3" seq="1" zindex="4" sequence="4"><image inbucketwidth="67" inbucketheight="67" onstagewidth="57" onstageheight="57" popwidth="96" popheight="96" onstagex="345" onstagey="200" baseheight="192" basewidth="192" pctstage="30" pctpop="50" pctbucket="35">4_ContainerShip.jpg</image><hotarea><point><x>4</x><y>325</y></point><point><x>123</x><y>270</y></point><point><x>194</x><y>262</y></point><point><x>234</x><y>253</y></point><point><x>317</x><y>208</y></point><point><x>364</x><y>179</y></point><point><x>413</x><y>152</y></point><point><x>410</x><y>323</y></point><point><x>168</x><y>327</y></point><point><x>5</x><y>327</y></point><point><x>5</x><y>326</y></point><point><x>4</x><y>325</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Barco de contenedores</tooltext><solvedtooltext>El barco de contenedores es un medio de transporte acuático. Sirve para trasladar enormes cantidades de mercancía metidas en contenedores.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B826EC0</imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="4" seq="1" zindex="5" sequence="5"><image inbucketwidth="67" inbucketheight="67" onstagewidth="57" onstageheight="57" popwidth="96" popheight="96" onstagex="282" onstagey="263" baseheight="192" basewidth="192" pctstage="30" pctpop="50" pctbucket="35">5_Submarine.jpg</image><hotarea><point><x>23</x><y>327</y></point><point><x>149</x><y>273</y></point><point><x>248</x><y>259</y></point><point><x>267</x><y>233</y></point><point><x>345</x><y>201</y></point><point><x>369</x><y>179</y></point><point><x>411</x><y>156</y></point><point><x>408</x><y>326</y></point><point><x>26</x><y>327</y></point><point><x>25</x><y>327</y></point><point><x>23</x><y>327</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Submarino</tooltext><solvedtooltext>El submarino es un medio de transporte acuático. Se desplaza sumergido bajo el agua aunque puede ascender a la superficie. Hay submarinos científicos y submarinos de guerra.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>29D293CE</imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="5" seq="1" zindex="6" sequence="6"><image inbucketwidth="67" inbucketheight="67" onstagewidth="57" onstageheight="57" popwidth="96" popheight="96" onstagex="137" onstagey="177" baseheight="192" basewidth="192" pctstage="30" pctpop="50" pctbucket="35">6_Bicycle.jpg</image><hotarea><point><x>2</x><y>124</y></point><point><x>28</x><y>123</y></point><point><x>60</x><y>140</y></point><point><x>107</x><y>122</y></point><point><x>181</x><y>123</y></point><point><x>256</x><y>94</y></point><point><x>323</x><y>112</y></point><point><x>324</x><y>140</y></point><point><x>228</x><y>190</y></point><point><x>275</x><y>228</y></point><point><x>246</x><y>260</y></point><point><x>172</x><y>271</y></point><point><x>153</x><y>271</y></point><point><x>21</x><y>329</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>327</y></point><point><x>3</x><y>124</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>124</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Bicicleta</tooltext><solvedtooltext>La bicicleta es un medio de transporte terrestre. Recuerda ponerte el casco siempre que la uses. Un tándem es una bici de dos plazas.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B825452</imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="6" seq="1" zindex="7" sequence="7"><image inbucketwidth="67" inbucketheight="67" onstagewidth="57" onstageheight="57" popwidth="96" popheight="96" onstagex="36" onstagey="144" baseheight="192" basewidth="192" pctstage="30" pctpop="50" pctbucket="35">7_Motorcycle.jpg</image><hotarea><point><x>14</x><y>329</y></point><point><x>83</x><y>289</y></point><point><x>150</x><y>271</y></point><point><x>219</x><y>262</y></point><point><x>252</x><y>255</y></point><point><x>274</x><y>227</y></point><point><x>291</x><y>216</y></point><point><x>216</x><y>169</y></point><point><x>153</x><y>129</y></point><point><x>107</x><y>131</y></point><point><x>75</x><y>140</y></point><point><x>60</x><y>145</y></point><point><x>29</x><y>134</y></point><point><x>4</x><y>130</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>323</y></point><point><x>14</x><y>327</y></point><point><x>14</x><y>329</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Motocicleta</tooltext><solvedtooltext>La motocicleta o moto es un medio de transporte terrestre. Tiene dos ruedas y nunca pueden ir más de dos personas montadas a la vez.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B82673C</imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="7" seq="1" zindex="8" sequence="8"><image inbucketwidth="67" inbucketheight="67" onstagewidth="57" onstageheight="57" popwidth="96" popheight="96" onstagex="13" onstagey="209" baseheight="192" basewidth="192" pctstage="30" pctpop="50" pctbucket="35">8_Bus.jpg</image><hotarea><point><x>12</x><y>326</y></point><point><x>61</x><y>303</y></point><point><x>146</x><y>271</y></point><point><x>187</x><y>265</y></point><point><x>226</x><y>259</y></point><point><x>254</x><y>237</y></point><point><x>282</x><y>213</y></point><point><x>174</x><y>126</y></point><point><x>121</x><y>133</y></point><point><x>77</x><y>141</y></point><point><x>56</x><y>149</y></point><point><x>30</x><y>134</y></point><point><x>8</x><y>131</y></point><point><x>0</x><y>140</y></point><point><x>3</x><y>292</y></point><point><x>4</x><y>316</y></point><point><x>5</x><y>328</y></point><point><x>8</x><y>328</y></point><point><x>12</x><y>326</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Bus</tooltext><solvedtooltext>El autobús o bus es un medio de transporte terrestre. Desplaza a grandes grupos de personas. </solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B826E50</imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="8" seq="1" zindex="9" sequence="9"><image inbucketwidth="67" inbucketheight="67" onstagewidth="57" onstageheight="57" popwidth="96" popheight="96" onstagex="93" onstagey="64" baseheight="192" basewidth="192" pctstage="30" pctpop="50" pctbucket="35">9_Balloon.jpg</image><hotarea><point><x>4</x><y>4</y></point><point><x>413</x><y>3</y></point><point><x>413</x><y>107</y></point><point><x>360</x><y>72</y></point><point><x>292</x><y>78</y></point><point><x>262</x><y>64</y></point><point><x>237</x><y>95</y></point><point><x>185</x><y>119</y></point><point><x>109</x><y>124</y></point><point><x>59</x><y>137</y></point><point><x>3</x><y>121</y></point><point><x>6</x><y>3</y></point><point><x>4</x><y>4</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Globo</tooltext><solvedtooltext>El globo es un medio de transporte aéreo. Tiene capacidad para desplazar poco peso. Asciende y se mueve cuando se calienta el aire.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B826CE5</imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="9" seq="1" zindex="10" sequence="10"><image inbucketwidth="67" inbucketheight="67" onstagewidth="57" onstageheight="57" popwidth="96" popheight="96" onstagex="313" onstagey="7" baseheight="192" basewidth="192" pctstage="30" pctpop="50" pctbucket="35">10_AirPlane.jpg</image><hotarea><point><x>2</x><y>2</y></point><point><x>412</x><y>4</y></point><point><x>410</x><y>96</y></point><point><x>354</x><y>72</y></point><point><x>312</x><y>72</y></point><point><x>280</x><y>78</y></point><point><x>271</x><y>65</y></point><point><x>242</x><y>95</y></point><point><x>100</x><y>124</y></point><point><x>50</x><y>129</y></point><point><x>5</x><y>113</y></point><point><x>3</x><y>4</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>2</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Avión</tooltext><solvedtooltext>El avión es un medio de transporte aéreo. Algunos aviones pueden desplazar decenas de personas, otros son más pequeños y pueden hacer de “espías”.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B8291E0</imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="10" seq="1" zindex="11" sequence="11"><image inbucketwidth="67" inbucketheight="67" onstagewidth="57" onstageheight="57" popwidth="96" popheight="96" onstagex="169" onstagey="7" baseheight="192" basewidth="192" pctstage="30" pctpop="50" pctbucket="35">11_Helicopter.jpg</image><hotarea><point><x>6</x><y>3</y></point><point><x>411</x><y>3</y></point><point><x>410</x><y>95</y></point><point><x>359</x><y>65</y></point><point><x>314</x><y>73</y></point><point><x>289</x><y>73</y></point><point><x>269</x><y>63</y></point><point><x>248</x><y>79</y></point><point><x>186</x><y>117</y></point><point><x>60</x><y>131</y></point><point><x>3</x><y>115</y></point><point><x>6</x><y>3</y></point><point><x>6</x><y>3</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Helicóptero</tooltext><solvedtooltext>El helicóptero es un medio de transporte aéreo. Es utilizado para desplazarse rápido hasta el centro de las ciudades, además de servir para controlar el tráfico.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B826F23</imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="11" seq="1" zindex="12" sequence="12"><image inbucketwidth="67" inbucketheight="67" onstagewidth="57" onstageheight="57" popwidth="96" popheight="96" onstagex="241" onstagey="7" baseheight="192" basewidth="192" pctstage="30" pctpop="50" pctbucket="35">12_Glider.jpg</image><hotarea><point><x>6</x><y>6</y></point><point><x>411</x><y>4</y></point><point><x>411</x><y>96</y></point><point><x>350</x><y>68</y></point><point><x>316</x><y>76</y></point><point><x>281</x><y>76</y></point><point><x>271</x><y>63</y></point><point><x>252</x><y>88</y></point><point><x>184</x><y>118</y></point><point><x>104</x><y>120</y></point><point><x>60</x><y>136</y></point><point><x>13</x><y>120</y></point><point><x>2</x><y>120</y></point><point><x>6</x><y>5</y></point><point><x>6</x><y>6</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Planeador</tooltext><solvedtooltext>El planeador es un medio de transporte aéreo. Es como un avión pequeño, pero no tiene motor y depende de las corrientes de aire para mantenerse en vuelo.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B82713D</imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="12" seq="1" zindex="13" sequence="13"><image inbucketwidth="67" inbucketheight="67" onstagewidth="57" onstageheight="57" popwidth="96" popheight="96" onstagex="218" onstagey="263" baseheight="192" basewidth="192" pctstage="30" pctpop="50" pctbucket="35">13_Cruiser.jpg</image><hotarea><point><x>18</x><y>329</y></point><point><x>89</x><y>289</y></point><point><x>156</x><y>261</y></point><point><x>209</x><y>263</y></point><point><x>256</x><y>250</y></point><point><x>280</x><y>224</y></point><point><x>353</x><y>199</y></point><point><x>366</x><y>180</y></point><point><x>412</x><y>156</y></point><point><x>410</x><y>173</y></point><point><x>412</x><y>214</y></point><point><x>405</x><y>263</y></point><point><x>408</x><y>301</y></point><point><x>408</x><y>322</y></point><point><x>163</x><y>324</y></point><point><x>42</x><y>325</y></point><point><x>19</x><y>329</y></point><point><x>18</x><y>329</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Crucero</tooltext><solvedtooltext>El crucero o trasatlántico es un medio de transporte acuático. Miles de turistas navegan de un rincón a otro del mundo en sus lujosas instalaciones.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B826EFA</imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="13" seq="1" zindex="14" sequence="14"><image inbucketwidth="67" inbucketheight="67" onstagewidth="57" onstageheight="57" popwidth="96" popheight="96" onstagex="281" onstagey="200" baseheight="192" basewidth="192" pctstage="30" pctpop="50" pctbucket="35">14_Ferry.jpg</image><hotarea><point><x>410</x><y>158</y></point><point><x>409</x><y>267</y></point><point><x>409</x><y>314</y></point><point><x>407</x><y>325</y></point><point><x>34</x><y>328</y></point><point><x>112</x><y>295</y></point><point><x>171</x><y>279</y></point><point><x>237</x><y>270</y></point><point><x>262</x><y>254</y></point><point><x>272</x><y>238</y></point><point><x>349</x><y>208</y></point><point><x>367</x><y>189</y></point><point><x>389</x><y>174</y></point><point><x>410</x><y>165</y></point><point><x>411</x><y>161</y></point><point><x>410</x><y>158</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Transbordador o &lt;i&gt;ferry&lt;/i&gt;</tooltext><solvedtooltext>El transbordador o &lt;i&gt;ferry&lt;/i&gt; es un medio de transporte acuático. Navega cerca de la costa sin recorrer grandes distancias.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid>1B826F0B</imagerefid><altitems/></item><item id="14" seq="1" zindex="15" sequence="15"><image inbucketwidth="67" inbucketheight="67" onstagewidth="57" onstageheight="57" popwidth="96" popheight="96" onstagex="10" onstagey="32" baseheight="192" basewidth="192" pctstage="30" pctpop="50" pctbucket="35">15_Rocket.jpg</image><hotarea><point><x>3</x><y>5</y></point><point><x>406</x><y>6</y></point><p